      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds great, thanks. i really like how you framed it as an \"undemocratic relic.\" it makes the argument feel very settled. do u think there are any actually valid arguments for keeping it, or is the whole thing pretty much just a way to undermine the will of the people?",
